<title>SPAIN: Metrovacesa to issue free share capital.</title>
<headline>Metrovacesa to issue free share capital.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish property company Metrovacesa said on Friday its shareholders' meeting had approved a free share issue for 562 million pesetas, to be charged to reserves.</p>
<p>It will give shareholders one new share for every 20 already held, with the same rights from 1997.</p>
